{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>南部戰區多艦艇編隊，近日展開多課目實戰化訓練。</p><p></p><p>解放軍官兵說：「發現空中目標，預備放。」</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.DRILL-1400_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026YxEcNeODek1792315550.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>官方微博指，由崑崙山艦、祁連山艦、五指山艦、長白山艦組成的艦艇編隊，前赴某海域。接到戰鬥警報後迅速變換隊形，雷達鎖定來襲目標，編隊下達抗擊命令，各艦相繼開火，完成對空攔阻打擊。</p><p></p><p>今次訓練模擬逼真戰場環境、訓練編隊，在複雜海空條件下的應急應戰能力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T09:58:44.231136+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T11:38:11.154374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T09:57:41.668703+00:00","content_hash":"7ed1d5018a6f0663854b55bd06c26315d53892a25c9c6dc356024e9db2e585a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}